{"text": "A person who lives eighty years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lives some twenty nine thousand days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the overwhelming majority of the behaviour packed into them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Runs on settings laid down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Most of them, decades earlier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And rarely inspected since. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This need not be a hopeless thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In one light. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is a triumph of engineering. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you had to consciously decide every footstep. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And every fork grip and every word. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You would never make it out of bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The deliberate mind is far too slow and too costly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To run a whole life in real time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And any creature that tried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Would be outcompeted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By a creature that did not. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The automation is precisely what frees the captain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To come up on deck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the few problems that actually require him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The default is not a flaw in the human design. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is arguably the central feature. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The thing that makes a complex life affordable at all.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "p", "e", "r", "s", "o", "n", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "s", " ", "e", "i", "g", "h", "t", "y", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "v", "e", "s", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "n", "i", "n", "e", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "a", "y", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A